---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn how Pervasive Capital connects infrastructure, technology, local partnerships, and market knowledge."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell content">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our company</p>
      <h1>Built to see the whole system.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Pervasive Capital brings infrastructure, technology, and market knowledge together
        to pursue practical opportunities in complex industries.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose-section">
    <div class="shell prose-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pervasive Capital</p>
        <h2>A connected view of value creation.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Our company works across telecommunications, automation, asset management, agriculture,
          and commodities. These fields may appear distinct, but each depends on the same
          foundations: reliable infrastructure, disciplined execution, aligned partnerships,
          and access to the right markets.
        </p>
        <p>
          We develop end-to-end approaches rather than isolated products. By coordinating local
          partners and combining physical and digital capabilities, we aim to reduce fragmentation,
          deepen operational understanding, and build systems that can adapt as demand changes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Pervasive Capital Investments Pte. Ltd. is based in Singapore and serves as the legal
          entity behind the Pervasive Capital brand.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="/solutions">Explore our solutions</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/vision">Read our vision</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
